DevSecOps — Security in CI/CD

🧠 What is DevSecOps?

DevSecOps means
👉 Integrating Security into DevOps
👉 Security is added from Day One, not at the end

🔄 Traditional vs DevSecOps

❌ Traditional Way
Security at the last stage
More bugs & delays

✅ DevSecOps Way

Security in Code, Build, Test & Deploy
Faster & safer releases

🔐 Where Security is Added in CI/CD?

🧩 Code Stage
Secure coding
Secrets scanning
🏗️ Build Stage
Dependency vulnerability scan
🧪 Test Stage
SAST & DAST
🚀 Deploy Stage
Container & cloud security checks

